  "notes": "USAGE: {保護|ほご} is used in contexts ranging from environmental protection to legal protection to parental care.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{保護|ほご}する (to protect)\n・{保護|ほご}を{受|う}ける (to receive protection)\n・{保護|ほご}の{下|もと}に (under protection)\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n・{環境|かんきょう}{保護|ほご} (environmental protection)\n・{保護|ほご}{者|しゃ} (guardian, protector)\n・{保護|ほご}{動物|どうぶつ} (protected animal)\n・{消費者|しょうひしゃ}{保護|ほご} (consumer protection)\n・{個人|こじん}{情報|じょうほう}{保護|ほご} (personal data protection)",
